<title>ISRAEL: ELECTRA CONSUMER Q2 EPS 0.88 SHEKELS.</title>
<headline>ELECTRA CONSUMER Q2 EPS 0.88 SHEKELS.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electra Consumer Products Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			 Q2 97    Q2 96	  6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		333,929  428,803	 560,298	727,761</p>
<p>Pre-tax Profit	24,176   35,488	  24,461	 50,531</p>
<p>Net Profit	    15,384   26,103	  16,140	 36,854</p>
<p>EPS (in shekels)	0.88     1.50	    0.93	   2.10</p>
<p>($1 = 3.54 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
